<div class=3D"PostContent">


<h3>Symptom</h3>
<p>When you attempt to run a <b>.js</b> (JScript Script File) file, one of =
the following errors may occur:</p>
<p class=3D"err">Can't find script engine "JScript" for script "<b>filename=
.js</b>".</p>
<p class=3D"err">There is no script engine for file extension ".js".</p>
<h3>Resolution</h3>
<p>This happens if the .js file class data is missing or incorrect. Follow =
these steps to resolve the problem:</p>
<p><b>Instructions for Windows Vista</b></p>
<p>Open an <a href=3D"https://web.archive.org/web/20080501183703/http://www=
.winhelponline.com/articles/158/1/How-to-open-an-elevated-Command-Prompt-in=
-Windows-Vista.html">Elevated Command Prompt</a> window. To do so, click <b=
>Start</b>, click <b>All Programs</b>, click <b>Accessories</b>, right-clic=
k <b>Command Prompt</b>, and then click <b>Run as administrator</b>.</p>
<ul>
<li>Type the following command and press ENTER: </li></ul>
<blockquote>
<p class=3D"registry">regsvr32 %systemroot%\system32\jscript.dll</p></block=
quote>
<ul>
<li>Type <strong>EXIT</strong> to close the Command Prompt window=20
</li><li>Download <b>vista_js_fix.reg</b> from the <b>Attachments</b> secti=
on (scroll below), and save it to Desktop=20
</li><li>Right-click <b>vista_js_fix.reg</b> and choose <b>Merge</b>=20
</li><li>Click Yes when asked for confirmation.</li></ul>
<p><b>Instructions for Windows XP</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Click Start, Run and type: </li></ul>
<blockquote>
<p class=3D"registry">regsvr32 %systemroot%\system32\jscript.dll</p></block=
quote>
<ul>
<li>Press <strong>ENTER</strong>=20
</li><li>Download <b>xp_js_fix.reg</b> from the <i><b>Attachments</b></i> s=
ection below, and save it to Desktop=20
</li><li>Right-click <b>xp_js_fix.reg</b> and choose <b>Merge</b>=20
</li><li>Click <b>Yes</b> when asked for confirmation.</li></ul>
<p>If the above does not solve the problem, then download and install Windo=
ws Script 5.7 from the following Microsoft Web site:</p>
<p><a href=3D"https://web.archive.org/web/20080501183703/http://www.microso=
ft.com/downloads/details.aspx?FamilyID=3D47809025-D896-482E-A0D6-524E7E844D=
81&amp;displaylang=3Den" target=3D"_blank">Download details: Windows Script=
 5.7 for Windows XP</a></p>
</div>

